verses.text:
Ye Nyɔmtsɛ Mawu
O he ngɛ nyakpɛ wawɛɛ,
Ke I hyɛ je ɔ nɛ O nine pee tsuo kulaa;
I naa dodoe, I nuɔ hiɔm' simi wawɛɛ;
O he wami kpa je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he.

Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ je weku tsuaa mi,
Ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ, ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ;
Lɛ pɛ nɛ Matsɛ pɛ ɔ sa.

O sa yi jemi Kliisto wa Kpɔlɔ;
O sa anunyam', bu, kɛ he wami,
O sa nɛ wa kɛ wa kla tsuo ja Mo.

Nyɛ tsuaa nyɛ wo nyɛ gbi nɔ kɛ je E yi;
He tsɔli kulaa nɛ kplasi ngɛ E hɛm',
Hiɔwe bɔfohi ngɛ Lɛ jae ke se ɔ;

Nyɔmtsɛ wa ba O hɛ mi kɛ lami;
O Mumu ha wɔ nyasa kɛ he wam',
Wa kɛ anunyam' ba ha Mo kɛ bumi.

Tuekpokutsɛmɛ kɛ mumuihi jeɔ E yi;
Nyɛ kɛ lilɛhi tsuo je E yi.
Hɛ ngmɛ yuli, nyɛɛ hyɛ Kpɔlɔ nɛ ma;
libɔ ɔ tu kɛ bua jɔm'
libɔ ɔ tu kɛ bua jɔm'.

Tsalɔ ngua sa kɛ su o he,
Ji mɔbɔ nalɔ Yesu;
Ke E tu munyu ɔ, ye tsui nɔɔ ye mi;
Suɔlɔ ɔ bu Yesu gbi tue.

Anunyam' ha Tobi ɔ nɛ ngɛ gboe;
Jehanɛ ɔ I heɔ Yesu ye;
I suɔ Kpɔlɔ ɔ nɛ a jɔɔ Lɛ,
I suɔ ye Yesu waa.

E biɛ fieɔ gbeye kɛ fɔ bum';
Biɛ kpa ko be pe Yesu
Ye kla na bua jɔm' ke e nu;
Yesu biɛ pɛ ji kpakpa.

E si E Tsɛ matsɛ s0 ɔ ngɛ hiɔwe;
E dloomi nɛ be nyagbe ɔ he,
E kua n- fɛɛ n- ngɛ suɔmi he;
Nɛ pue muɔ si ha Adam nina.
Mɔbɔ nam' nɛ mi kuɔ ɔ,
Mawu kɛ he adesa yiwa nam'.

Yesu nɛ le wa dengme tsuo gbomi;
Nɛ E maa nyɛɛ wa hɛ mi daa kɛ daa;
Huɛ ko kulaa be nɛ pe Yesu Kliisto,
Nɔ ko be kulaaƐ nɔ ko be kulaa.

O kɛ O wami ha ngua kɛ wayo tsuo,
O wami ji wami nihi tsuɛɛ pɛ a wam';
Wa peeɔ flɔuuflɔuu kaa ba nɛ ngɛ tso nɔ;
Se Mo lɛɛ O gbɔjɔ we nɛ O be tsake.

Anunyamitsɛ kpana kanetsɛ nɛ he tsɔ;
O bɔfo ɔmɛ jaa Mo, se wɔ lɛ wa n0;
Wa kɛ yi jem' tsuo ma ha Mo, wa wɔ nɛ wa na Mo,
Ngɛ kane gbongaa a mi.

Jɔmi gbi fiami Yesu ji ye nɔ,
O hiɔwe anunyam' nɛ wa sa nya;
Wɔ nihi nɛ a kpɔ wɔ, Mawu he wɔ;
E mumu fɔ wɔ, E muɔ tsu wa he.

He siba nɛ hi, kulaa ba nyagbe;
I ngɛ Nyɔmtsɛ ɔ mi gbaam' bua kɛ jɔm';
I ngɛ huɔe, ngɛ mlɛe, ngɛ hiɔwe hyɛe,
E suɔmi kɛ nihi kpakpa hyi mi.

O dloomi ɔ nɛ ha mi he wam' kɛ ha ye tsui;
Wo ye gɛjɛm' nɔ, bɔ nɛ O gbo ha mi,
Ye suɔmi kɛ ha Mo nɛ he tsɔ nɛ tsake we la nɛ ngɛ.

Ke I nyɛɛ wam' diblii ɔ mi, nɛ aywilɛho bɔle mi,
Mo kudɔ mi; diblii nɛ plɛ kane;
Tsu ye hɛ mi vo nyu; ko ha nɛ ma je O kasami kulaa.

Nyɛ he a yi wa nam', nyɛ juɛ a gbenɔ he,
Nyɛ gbla mɛ kɛ je yayam', kɛ gbenɔ mi ;
Fo kɛ ha nihi nɛ a tɔ, wo si kolɔ ɔ nɔ;
De mɛ ke Yesu he wam' maa kpɔ mɛ.

Ke kunim' okadi je kpo, Abosiam' weku fia,
Klistofo'i ta buli, nyɛ ya kɛ kunim';
Gbeje kpangme hosoɔ, ke e nu yi jem' ngmla a;
Nyɛmimɛ, nyɛ wo gbi nɔ kɛ bɔ ose wawɛɛ.

Te si, da si ha YesuƐ Da si kɛ E he wam' pɛ,
He lo he wam' ma kua nyɛ, nyɛɛ ko kpasa nyɛ he;
Kɛ munyu ɔ pee ta tade, nɛ nyɛ hwɔɔ kɛ sɔlemi,
DS Ni tsumi loo osla mi,
O he maa hia ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.
ɔ Te si, da si ha Yesu ta humi ɔ se be kɛe,
Mwɔnɛ ɔ ta hwumi ngɛ pɛe;
Hwɔ lɛ kunim' lami
Nɔ nɛ ma ye kunimi wami jlasi ma pee e nɔ;
DS E kɛ anunyam' Matsɛ maa ye matsɛ kɛ ya daa.

Wa fa kue konɛ dloomi ya su he fɛɛ he;
Kpɛ kane ɔ, Kpɛ kane ɔ,
Konɛ Kristo mumi nɛ hi he fɛɛ he.

Pɔ nɛ ko tɔ wa he ngɛ suɔm' ni tsum' he,
Kpɛ kane ɔ, Kpɛ kane ɔ;
Wa hla weto ni kɛ ha hiɔwe jlasi.

Ke I pee kaa blɔ tlalɔ nɛ pu ɔ nɔ si,
Nɛ diblii ha ye nɔ, I kpasa tɛ;
Ngɛ ye nlami ɔ mi ɔ ma su O he, Mawu lee,

Ha ma na blɔ kɛ ya hiɔwe ma a mi,
Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ O ha mi je O mɔbɔ nam';
Bɔfohi ngɛ mi tsɛe kɛ ba O ngɔ, Mawu lee

I suɔ Mo ejakaa O sɛ hlam' suɔ mi,
O he ye yayami ɔ ngɛ Kalvali tso ɔ nɔ;
I suɔ O sane 'jakaa O bu mio pɛɛ ha mi.

Kaa tsɛi kɛ po o he piɛ;
Ke kamihi bɔle mo kɛ kpe,
Fa kue ngɛ E biɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ mi.

Kane 'o jɔɔmihi, tsɛ a biɛ kakaaka,
Kane 'o jɔɔmihi, hyɛ nɔ nɛ Mawu pee;
Kane 'o jɔɔmi, tsɛ mɛ kakaaka;
Kane o' jɔɔmihi fuu nɛ o hyɛ nɔ nɛ Mawu pee.

Ee, wa ma bua ngɛ pa nɛ ɔ nya;
Pa nɛ ngɛ fɛu, pa nɛ ngɛ fɛu nɛ ɔ e nya;
Wa kɛ he tsɔli maa bua he nya,
Ngɛ pa nɛ ngɛ Mawu sɛ ɔ hɛ mi.

Mo gba mi Yesu he sane,
Nɛ o ngma munyu ɔ ngɛ ye tsui mi;
Gbaa mi sane nɛ he jua wa,
Ngɔɔ wawɛɛ ke a nu;
Gba mi bɔ nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ la,
Benɛ a nya E fɔmi he;
Tuem' jɔmi sane ha je ɔ tsuo.

Nyɔmtsɛ, wa ba O hɛ mi piɔ,
Nɛ wa kplasi ngɛ O hɛm';
O ko ha wa sane pee gu;
Yakatsuaa wa hla Mo lo?
Yakatsuaa wa hla Mo lo?

Kɛ mi hi si diblii ngɛ woe kɛ ma,
Diblii ɔ mi ti, Nyɔmtsɛ kɛ mi hi si
Ke wami tsuo ta nɛ bua jɔm' hu je;
Yem'kɛ bualɔ kpetekple kɛm' hi si.
Wa wam' ligbi kpiti ɔmɛ ngɛ bee;
Je ɔ m' ngɔɔmi kɛ e hɛm'nyam' be kɛ ho,
Tsakemi kɛ nihi nɛ puɛ I ngɛ hyiɛe;
Mo nɛ O tsake we O kɛm' hi si.

Mo bli nyu vu nɛ ngɛ ngleingleii ɔ nya,
He nɛ tsami nyu ɔ jeɔ kɛ ba;
Ha nɛ la kɛ bɔ kuu titima
Nyɛɛ ye hɛm' ngɛ blɔ hiami nɛ ɔ nɔ;
Kpɔlɔ he walɔ, Kpɔlɔ he walɔ,
Mo pee ye he walɔ kɛ he falɔ;
Kpɔlɔ he walɔ, Kpɔlɔ he walɔ,
Mo pee ye he walɔ nɛ ha ye nɔ.

O suɔ nɛ o je yayam' tloomi ɔ sisi?
He wam' ngɛ muɔ ɔ mi, he wam' ngɛ muɔ ɔ mi;
O suɔ nɛ o ye yayami nɔ kunim'?

O suɔ nɛ o kpa he nɔ wom' kɛ akɔnɔ?
He wam' ngɛ muɔ ɔ mi, he wam' ngɛ muɔ ɔ mi;
Moo ba Kalvali nɛ o tsu o he.

O suɔ nɛ o he tsɔ pe gbiɛngongu lo?
He wam' ngɛ muɔ ɔ mi, he wam' ngɛ muɔ ɔ mi;
Yayam' he so laa ngɛ E muɔ ɔ mi.

O suɔ nɛ o tsu ni ha Matsɛ Yesu?
He wam' ngɛ muɔ ɔ mi, he wam' ngɛ muɔ ɔ mi;
Anɛ o ma la yi jem' la daa ha Lɛ?

Ngɛ huɛ bɔm' ngɔngɔɛ mi, wa maa hi E nane nya,
Wa kɛ Lɛ maa nyɛɛ kɛ ya he tsuo;
Wa maa ye E gbi nɔ, he nɛ E tsɔ wa maa ya;
Koo ye gbeye, mo he ye, bu tue.

Yesu ngɛ pɛɛ kpae, wa jɔɔ tsle tomi;
E ngɛ mo kɛ imi pɛɛ kpae;
Wa ko mlɛ nɛ mɔbɔ nam' nɛ ɔ nɛ be,
Mɔbɔ nam' ha mo kɛ imi.

Ni tsumi ngua a, E ba gbe nya;
Nyɔmtsɛ ji ye nɔ, E nɔ ji mi;
E kpaka mi nɛ I nyɛɛ E se,
E gbi ngɔngɔɛ nɛ ngɔɔ ye nya.

Nyɔmtsɛ, I suɔ ma pee Klistofono ngɛ ye tsui mi, ngɛ
ye tsui mi;
Nyɔmtsɛ, I suɔ ma pee Kristofono ngɛ ye tsui mi.

Kpoo mi E kɛ E 'nunyam' fɔ si,
Bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa ko gbo;
A fɔ Lɛ nɛ E ba kp- wɔ,
Konɛ a fɔ wɔ enyɔne,
Mawu nɛ ba he lo mi;
Nyɛɛ hyɛ Mawu nɛ je E he kpo,
Nɛ E kɛ adesa ba hi si;
Yesu, wa Imanuɛl
Nɛ e kɛ adesa ba hi si
Yesu, wa Imanuɛl

Kristo nɛ a gbaa Lɛ ɔ haa wɔ tsuo,
Nyakpɛ wami sane ɔ;
Yayam' peelɔ, bu suɔm' tsɛmi tue,
Nyakpɛ wami sane;
A kɛ lɛ tsuo ha wɔ,
Kɛ ha wa hiɔwe yami'.

Ngɔɔ o haom' ha Yesu mwɔnɛ;
Ngmɛɛ o kɔmɔ kɛ gbeyemi he:
A jeɔ tloomi ɔ ngɛ Kalvali;
Yesu su o he haa.

Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nu munyu ɔ fia he gbi;
Gbɛɛ jɔɔmi munyu ɔ kɛ ya je ɔ mi tsuo pɛ;
De bua jɔm' sane ɔ he nɛ adesa ngɛ,

Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ suɔ, si womi ɔ ye emu,
Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ suɔ, e sa nɛ e fi si,
Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ suɔ nɔ ji wam' nɛ be nyagbe;

I ma ye juɛm' si kaa ma ya Kpɔlɔ ɔ ngɔ;
Ma si yayam' kɛ pɛ wom';
Lɛ ji 'nɔkualetsɛ, Lɛ ji dalɔtsɛ,
Wam' munyu ɔ ngɛ E dɛm'.

Wa mi O Mawu, nɛ ye tsui mi nɛ tsɔ;
I kɛ ye wami tsuo maa wo O dɛ.
Hwɔɔ mi ma ko bɔ ko;
Kɛ O suɔm' kpakpa tsɔɔ m' blɔ,
Mo wa mi nɛ ye tsui mi tsɔ.

Wa mi O Mawu, nɛ ye tsuim' nɛ tsɔ;
Tsɔɔ mi O suɔm' nya ni konɛ ma pee;
Pee ye huɛ nɛ O tsɔɔ mi blɔ,
Ha nɛ I kɛ Mo hi si;
Mo wa mi nɛ ye tsui mi tsɔ.

Wa mi O Mawu nɛ ye tsui mi tsɔ;
Kaa ma na O klɔuklɔu hɛm' ligbi ko;
Tsɛm' kɛ je zim' nihi a he,
Mo ye ye sus'ma nɔ,
Mo wa mi nɛ ye tsui mi tsɔ.

Adesa wam' he piɛ pomi,
Mawu nɛ hɛɛ ngɛ E dɛ mi;
Adesa ma hla se e be nae;
Mawu pɛ nɛ maa nu sisi.

Ye Nyɔmtsɛ, I ma, ma ba O ngɔ piɔ ɔ;
Fɔ ye he, tsukɔ mi ngɛ muɔ ɔ
Nɛ bee ngɛ Kalvali.

E ma nɔ mi kɛ ha,
Kɛ ha 'nɔkuale tsui;
E nya si womi maa bam';
Ha tuebuli kɛ peeli.

Nyɛɛ hyɛ, Matsɛ ngua a ma,
Hiɔ tsami' ngɛ E dɛ mi;
E kɛ kpɔmi ba ha klahi nɛ a wo mɛ tsu,
Tsu nɛ e mi je gu, kunim' la nɛ jije;
Nyɔmtsɛ pe matsɛmɛ tsuo.
O suɔmi nɛ je hiɔwe

Anunyam' ha E biɛ, anunyam' ha E biɛ;
Lejɛ ɔ nɛ E kɛ E muɔ ta ye tsui he,
Anunyam' ha E biɛ.

Mo ba vu nyu nɛ ngɔɔ wawɛɛ ɔ he,
Kɛ o kla fɔ Kpɔlɔ ɔ nane nya;
Tuu kɛ sɛ mi nɛ o maa ye emu;
Anunyam' ha E biɛ.

Hɛm' kɛ hɛ mi be ngɔngɔɛ ɔ mi,
Wa maa na Lɛ hɛm' kɛ hɛ m';
Wa maa na Kpɔlɔ hɛm' kɛ hɛ m';
Yesu Klisto nɛ suɔ mi.

Ni dumi ngɛ pu ɔ nɔ, ni dumi ngɛ hɔ mi,
Wa yi bɔ kuu gbeye, fiɛ nganii hu po;
Hwɔ se ko ni kpami ɔ ni tsumi ɔ se maa po;
Wa kɛ bua jɔm' maa ngɔ ni kpami ɔ kɛ ba.

Nyɛ ko ye gbeye, kuu nyafii, Kpɔlɔ ke,
Tsaatsɛ suɔ kaa matsɛ yemi ɔ pee nyɛ nɔ;
Nyɛ ko ngɔ hiɛmi nɛ ɔ mu kɛ wo nyɛ tade mɛ;
Ye to ɔmɛ ma hiɛ futaa pe gbiɛngongu.

Gble ka amɛ a nɔ nɛ jɔɔ mo ngmla kpami;
Yesu to tsɔlɔ nɛ E nine ji a wesa he.
E be mo kuae gble, E ji nyɛmi kɛ huɛ;
E ma suɔ mo nɛ E ma kpɔ mo ngɛ je ɔ nyagbe.
